1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,780
Hier,

2
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:02,900
je te parlais du classeur HACCP rempli

3
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:03,860
à vingt-trois heures.

4
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,580
Voici l'application qui le remplace.

5
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:06,540
Tu ouvres le frigo,

6
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:07,620
tu touches l'équipement,

7
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:08,820
tu notes la température.

8
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:09,620
Si c'est trop chaud,

9
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:10,620
elle te dit quoi faire,

10
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:11,320
tout de suite.

11
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:12,180
Tu as les mains prises ?

12
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:12,920
Tu lui parles.

13
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,400
Elle imprime aussi tes étiquettes de date

14
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:14,960
limite.

15
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,100
Et le jour du contrôle,

16
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,120
tout l'historique est là.

17
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,360
Commente HACCP,

18
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:19,580
je t'envoie le lien.
